<title>FRANCE: EU grants preferential maize imports to Spain.</title>
<headline>EU grants preferential maize imports to Spain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday awarded tariff cuts for some 328,000 tonnes of preferential maize imports to Spain, European grain officials said.</p>
<p>There was no immediate word of the extent of the tariff cuts involved, but traders said earlier there had been &quot;aggressive&quot; bids for at least 400,000 to 500,000 tonnes of maize at Ecu reductions in the high fifties upwards.</p>
</text>
